# Troubleshooting & Platform Considerations

## Common Issues to Watch For
- CORS problems: Check middleware origins setup in main.py
- Static file serving: Verify mount paths match build tool output
- Environment variables: Check both .env files and header overrides
- Vector DB connections: Verify service availability and configuration
- Request/response model validation in FastAPI endpoints

## Cross-Platform Considerations
- Use `os.path.join()` for file paths to ensure compatibility
- macOS calendar features should degrade gracefully on other platforms
- Ensure PyInstaller builds work on all target platforms
- Consider Windows vs Unix process handling differences

## Documentation Requirements
- Keep README installation instructions current
- Use FastAPI's automatic OpenAPI generation
- Document React component props and usage patterns
- Provide webhook configuration examples
- Document all environment variables and settings
